<title>FRANCE: No changes to daily EU grain export refunds.</title>
<headline>No changes to daily EU grain export refunds.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union made no changes to standing refunds for grain exports at Thursday's weekly grain talks in Brussels, member country officials said.</p>
<p>The standing refunds apply to the EU's daily export channel, an alternative export mechanism to the weekly tendering process.</p>
</text>
